- relationship: original 4 — B2 wants workplace formality from an old colleague and B4 insists their present positions differ. Result 4 — B2 wants managerial presentation preserved and B4 negotiates the story's timing instead of simply repeating the objection.
- heightening: original 3 — A5 upgrades biscuit price but does not intensify the shared-beginnings argument. Result 4 — A5 makes B perform present-day sharing and claims responsibility for introductions, extending equality into control of the encounter.
