- brevityWit: original 4 — A3's 'Fellow Biscuit Packer with an Office' follows the card precisely; A5 earns less from that shared history. Result 4 — A3 technically uses 'director' while telling an intimate lunch story; A5's 'He's sharing today' turns B4's correction into another familiarity claim.

